## About DeskVNC

This repository is a community resource hub for DeskVNC. It does not
redistribute DeskVNC source or binaries. DeskVNC itself is a separate project
licensed by its maintainers under either of:

- Apache License, Version 2.0
- MIT License

at the user's option. The full terms, and the source, live at
<https://github.com/psmux/DeskVNC>.

Short factual material reproduced from the DeskVNC README on this hub is used
with attribution and remains under the DeskVNC project's own license.
